<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia to privatise aluminium fitting firm.</title>
<headline>Tunisia to privatise aluminium fitting firm.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian government on Tuesday launched a tender to sell off its assets in a firm specialised in aluminium fitting as part of its privatisation programme.</p>
<p>IMAL has a capital of 57,000 dinars fully subscribed by the state-owned Societe Tunisienne de Banques.</p>
<p>It had a turnover of 328,528 dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>($=0.97 dinar)</p>
